#### full-uploads across distinct renderer dependency-token gaps

- Verify: full-uploads across distinct renderer dependency-token gaps
   - Expected: first.is_empty() is false
   - Expected: second.is_empty() is false
   - Expected: opencl_font_atlas_dirty_upload_bytes(second, first.atlas_generation, false) equals `0`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 14 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: full-uploads across distinct renderer dependency-token gaps")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
var first_renderer = FontRenderer.new()
var skipped_renderer = FontRenderer.new()
var second_renderer = FontRenderer.new()
val first = first_renderer.prepare_text("A", 0xffffffffu32, 16)
skipped_renderer.prepare_text("X", 0xffffffffu32, 16)
val second = second_renderer.prepare_text("B", 0xffffffffu32, 16)

expect(first.is_empty()).to_equal(false)
expect(second.is_empty()).to_equal(false)
expect(first.atlas_generation).to_be_greater_than(0)
expect(second.atlas_generation).to_be_greater_than(first.atlas_generation + 1)
expect(opencl_font_atlas_dirty_upload_bytes(second, first.atlas_generation, false)).to_equal(0)
```

